{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an Auto Battler filled with strategy and creativity. Plan your team carefully and send them into randomly generated dungeons that change every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles occur automatically your role is to prepare your team to be as ready as possible before entering the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters with powerful items and spellbooks. Mix and match characters, items, and skills to build a team in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique characters and more than 100 items and skills to discover, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations, find powerful synergies, and adapt to new challenges every time you enter the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, and conquer the dungeon your way!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801530?t=1755168913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801530?t=1755168913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801530/fdde77e8d8c0d77bf511bb924964612264d4c664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755168913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801530/fdde77e8d8c0d77bf511bb924964612264d4c664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755168913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3916090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an Auto Battler filled with strategy and creativity. Plan your team carefully and send them into randomly generated dungeons that change every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles occur automatically your role is to prepare your team to be as ready as possible before entering the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters with powerful items and spellbooks. Mix and match characters, items, and skills to build a team in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 100 unique characters and more than 100 items and skills to discover, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations, find powerful synergies, and adapt to new challenges every time you enter the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team, and conquer the dungeon your way!</p>","developers":["Zemon"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801530/41f3a3f72f926d367acaeb828a552d696b3fe175/header.jpg?t=1755168913","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3801530/978443607/22c52047f55b8f8943f59f45221917a86d5f7328/1753170163/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753171167","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3801530/978443607/22c52047f55b8f8943f59f45221917a86d5f7328/1753170163/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753171167","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3801530/978443607/22c52047f55b8f8943f59f45221917a86d5f7328/1753170163/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753171167","id":257172209,"name":"Dungeon Fight Tactics Mini Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172209/07d35cdb60f1dfba82b4be14506a940